              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 7,
                "text_start": "And it is possible to see this",
                "text_end": "It is right to take heed with regard to the future"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 8,
                "text_start": "It is right to take heed with regard to the future",
                "text_end": "adopting needful changes"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 9,
                "text_start": "adopting needful changes",
                "text_end": "For whereas Haman, a Macedonian"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 10,
                "text_start": "For whereas Haman, a Macedonian",
                "text_end": "obtained so large a share of our universal kindness"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 11,
                "text_start": "obtained so large a share of our universal kindness",
                "text_end": "he however, overcome by pride"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 12,
                "text_start": "he however, overcome by pride",
                "text_end": "having by various and subtle artifices"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 13,
                "text_start": "having by various and subtle artifices",
                "text_end": "For by these methods he thought"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 14,
                "text_start": "For by these methods he thought",
                "text_end": "But we find that the Jews"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 15,
                "text_start": "But we find that the Jews",
                "text_end": "and being the sons of the living God"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 16,
                "text_start": "and being the sons of the living God",
                "text_end": "You will therefore do well in refusing"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 17,
                "text_start": "You will therefore do well in refusing",
                "text_end": "because he who has done these things"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 18,
                "text_start": "because he who has done these things",
                "text_end": "We enjoin you then"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 19,
                "text_start": "We enjoin you then",
                "text_end": "and to strengthen them"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 20,
                "text_start": "and to strengthen them",
                "text_end": "For in the place of the destruction"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 21,
                "text_start": "For in the place of the destruction",
                "text_end": "Therefore you also, among your notable feasts"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 22,
                "text_start": "Therefore you also, among your notable feasts",
                "text_end": "that both now and hereafter"
              },
              {
                "source_book": "est",
                "source_chapter": 8,
                "source_verses": [
                  13,
                  13
                ],
                "app_verse_start": 23,
